    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Replace the Registry Wasm. Auth: admin (checked BEFORE the swap).\\n\\nThe gen-1 Registry shipped WITHOUT this (\"holds no funds, keep it dumb\")\\nand that immutability backfired: the 2026-08-01 audit fixes touched\\nRegistry code, and with Factory + every Strategy holding this address\\npermanently, the only patch path was discarding the entire fleet. The\\nadmin already controls everything the Registry decides (whitelist,\\nrouter, keeper, fees), so an admin-gated upgrade adds repairability\\nwithout adding power.",
      "name": "upgrade",
      "inputs": [
